    narr:narration """This hub covers the adoption decision for Zypherion as the organization's analytics database, as recorded in a single session dated 20260718. The record is structured in layers: Quinton Fairweather's direct commissive — [adopting Zypherion for the analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) — anchors the decision, followed by a [composite declarative turn](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) that bundles commitment, performance claim, and timeline into one announcement. The performance rationale is carried separately as [15x columnar query speed](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3), framed with expert/rational-persuasion power. The timeline commitment — [migration starts next quarter](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) — is tagged as future-irrealis and carries a pressure dimension distinct from the rest of the turn. A [session-level summary](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5) restates the same three points (database, performance, timeline) without attributing them to Quinton, framing them as what the conversation settled. No dissenting or qualifying voices appear in the children.""" ;
